#: ../../guide/bit-exactness.md:1
#: 57f637d92c7b47a0866a83553858c9ae
msgid "Bit-exactness & parity"
msgstr "Bitgenauegkeet & Paritéit"

#: ../../guide/bit-exactness.md:3
#: 5a4bcf17e2244d4ea823c2a7a207c388
msgid "parsecore's star ratings and pp values are **bit-for-bit identical** to the official osu! implementation. This is the project's core promise."
msgstr "D'Star-Ratings an d'pp-Wäerter vu parsecore sinn **Bit fir Bit identesch** mat der offizieller osu!-Implementatioun. Dat ass d'Haaptversprieche vum Projet."

#: ../../guide/bit-exactness.md:6
#: 946d7723dffd43a2bcf23ad3fa34cd20
msgid "How it's achieved"
msgstr "Wéi dat erreecht gëtt"

#: ../../guide/bit-exactness.md:8
#: a7cf2f88f5c54448ad22f475c4965eca
msgid "Reproducing the reference *closely* is not enough parsecore reproduces it *exactly*, including the floating-point behaviour of the original:"
msgstr "D'Referenz nëmmen *ongeféier* nozebauen ass net genuch. parsecore reproduzéiert se *exakt*, inklusiv dem Verhale vun de Gleitkommazuele vum Original:"

#: ../../guide/bit-exactness.md:12
#: f789240bdf5e4edc9fbc9a67ab5e543c
msgid "**f32 intermediates** positions, curve math and several constants are computed in 32-bit floats, matching the game client (and rosu-pp's Rust ``f32``)."
msgstr "**f32-Tëscheresultater** Positiounen, Kureberechnungen a verschidde Konstante gi mat 32-Bit-Gleitkommazuele berechent, genee wéi am Spillclient an am Rust-`f32` vu rosu-pp."

#: ../../guide/bit-exactness.md:14
#: 2439c5a0807841a48d810b6d4ef8af85
msgid "**Explicit integer powers** ``x * x * x`` where the reference uses ``DiffUtils.Pow(x, 3)``, not ``math.pow`` (they can differ in the last bit)."
msgstr "**Explizit ganzzueleg Potenzen** `x * x * x`, wann d'Referenz `DiffUtils.Pow(x, 3)` benotzt, an net `math.pow` (si kënnen sech am leschte Bit ënnerscheeden)."

#: ../../guide/bit-exactness.md:16
#: b756206e3aeb4b4cad30daba18ad54e5
msgid "**IEEE semantics** division by zero, NaN handling and negative-base powers follow Rust/C# rules via dedicated helpers (``ieee_div``, ``rust_min``, ...), never Python's exceptions."
msgstr "**IEEE-Semantik** Divisioun duerch null, d'Veraarbechtung vun NaN a Potenze mat negativer Basis follegen iwwer speziell Hëllefsfunktiounen (`ieee_div`, `rust_min`, ...) de Reegelen aus Rust/C#, amplaz Python-Exceptions auszeléisen."

#: ../../guide/bit-exactness.md:19
#: 7d93326798fa4f57a593b9d357bda3a1
msgid "**Exact RNG and sorting** the legacy converters use osu!stable's RNG in the exact call order, and the C# unstable sort is reproduced for nested slider objects."
msgstr "**Exakten RNG an exakt Zortéierung** D'Legacy-Konvertere benotzen den RNG vun osu!stable an der exakt selwechter Opruffreeiefolleg, an déi onstabil Zortéierung vu C# gëtt fir agebett Slider-Objeten nogebaut."

#: ../../guide/bit-exactness.md:23
#: ed278f9b4e46438c88de30932f1046e8
msgid "How it's verified"
msgstr "Wéi dat iwwerpréift gëtt"

#: ../../guide/bit-exactness.md:25
#: 33516f9f1a464629bff4dc4ac532b76b
msgid "Correctness is enforced by a parity test suite that compares parsecore against an oracle built from the official `ppy.osu.Game` packages (with rosu-pp as a secondary cross-check):"
msgstr "D'Korrektheet gëtt duerch eng Paritéitstestsuite garantéiert, déi parsecore mat enger Referenz vergläicht, déi op den offiziellen `ppy.osu.Game`-Packages baséiert, mat rosu-pp als zousätzlecher Kräizkontroll:"

#: ../../guide/bit-exactness.md:29
#: 8146088c14fe49eb8bcd338fb428fc01
msgid "4,400+ cases: star ratings and pp across all four rulesets"
msgstr "4.400+ Testfäll: Star-Ratings a pp iwwer all véier Rulesets"

#: ../../guide/bit-exactness.md:30
#: 3cd9cc7d3fbc48eb9ad10758061df6cd
msgid "extended mod matrix (EZ/HR/DT/NC/HT/HD/FL/TD/RX/AP/SO, key mods 1K-9K, combinations)"
msgstr "Erweidert Mod-Matrix (EZ/HR/DT/NC/HT/HD/FL/TD/RX/AP/SO, Tastemods 1K–9K, Kombinatiounen)"

#: ../../guide/bit-exactness.md:31
#: f3d7443257b140e7871450f567ae9480
msgid "all convert directions, native maps, edge-case and pathological maps"
msgstr "All Konvertéierungsrichtungen, nativ Maps, Grenzfäll a pathologesch Maps"

#: ../../guide/bit-exactness.md:32
#: 210555e86bdb4a81baa3e2925ff99f60
msgid "randomized full score states, partial states, fails, lazer & stable scores"
msgstr "Zoufälleg generéiert voll Score-Zoustänn, deelweis Zoustänn, Fehlschléi, Lazer- a Stable-Scores"

#: ../../guide/bit-exactness.md:33
#: 3c5702a544e449be8fe8df7298e04104
msgid "**result: 0 differences every value bit-identical to the official implementation**"
msgstr "**Resultat: 0 Ënnerscheeder all Wäert ass Bit fir Bit identesch mat der offizieller Implementatioun**"

#: ../../guide/bit-exactness.md:37
#: ec993cc0313a4aa6b3a83998d0cde740
msgid "After a pp rework deploys, public calculators and bots that rely on outdated libraries can disagree with parsecore. When in doubt: new scores set in-game receive exactly the values parsecore computes."
msgstr "Nodeems e pp-Rework ausgerullt gouf, kënnen ëffentlech Rechner a Bots, déi op vereelzte Bibliothéike baséieren, aner Resultater wéi parsecore weisen. Am Zweiwelsfall: Nei Scores, déi am Spill erzielt ginn, kréien exakt déi Wäerter, déi parsecore berechent."

